{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>כִּי אִם יִהְיֶה לְבָעֵר וְגוֹ׳.</b> Meaning: he considered the calamities that could befall the Kenite, and he said ״עַד מָה״ — meaning, until when would be the measure of the troubles that would come upon him. <b>אַשּׁוּר תִּשְׁבֶּךָּ</b> — meaning, that Ashur, namely Sennacherib, would rule over him and lead him into captivity."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:14:02.374876991Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}